//   non-EOS token is appended once via `AppendConstrainedToken`, so visible
//   growth is at most the consumed budget. In the symbol branch,
//   `ConstrainedSymbolInGenerated` consumes `stepsUsed` token-steps and visible
//   constrained growth is at most those consumed steps, even if some sampled
